went on to remind him that every god in Olympia was planning to try to sabotage Heracles at the Games. "So

16
00:01:29.932 --> 00:01:34.321
your brother is in great danger," Markos added. "We

17
00:01:34.322 --> 00:01:38.541
think we can save him from Tartarus, but we'll need your help." Julia

18
00:01:38.542 --> 00:01:43.845
held her breath. She was sure he would want to help his brother. But

19
00:01:43.846 --> 00:01:48.220
Iphicles seemed quiet and brooding most of the time. What

