27
00:02:28.626 --> 00:02:35.846
heard many of them plotting and scheming myself, even though everyone must know I'm Heracles' brother." "Yes,

28
00:02:35.847 --> 00:02:40.933
we're counting on their lack of secrecy," Markos said. "We've

