00:02:40.934 --> 00:02:44.623
already figured out what a few of them are planning." He

30
00:02:44.624 --> 00:02:52.720
and Julia filled Iphicles in on what they'd learned from the gods. When they finished, Iphicles nodded again. "All

31
00:02:52.721 --> 00:02:59.112
