33
00:03:03.053 --> 00:03:10.830
Julia smiled at him. She was already feeling more optimistic about the Games. "Brody

34
00:03:10.831 --> 00:03:15.639
is supposed to be telling Heracles about all this right now. Let's

35
00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:22.404
go find them and make sure that happened." *

