women. "Go and warm up with the other athletes," Hermes told Brody, gesturing toward the

55
00:05:06.124 --> 00:05:11.605
track. "I'll come to advise you once I've found your companion a place to sit with the other gods' mortal

56
00:05:11.606 --> 00:05:16.227
guests." He patted Markos on the shoulder, and then he glanced at

57
